    "goal": "Prove in Lean 4 over ℕ the identity ∑ k in Finset.range (n+1), ballotNumber n k = (2*n+1).choose n, reusing the parent's ballotNumber definition and its closed form; a genuine bijective (Finset-of-paths) proof is out of scope."
